  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Economic Management Program, Subprogram 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program will help the Government of Tonga implement reforms to mitigate fragilities intensified by the coronavirus disease (COVID-19) pandemic, and the 2022 volcanic eruption at Hunga Tonga&#x2013;Hunga Ha&#x2018;apai (HTHH) and associated tsunami waves. The program will also build resilience against disasters, which will be intensified by climate change. The program comprises two subprograms that will (i) strengthen public sector management and sustainability, and (ii) boost social and economic resilience in Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
