     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax-to-GDP Ratio: The project focuses on fiscal management reforms, including tax policy enhancements and improved tax administration. Despite economic setbacks from cyclones and the COVID-19 border lockdown, the tax-to-GDP ratio increased from 15.9% in FY2012 to 22.9% in FY2021. This positive trend reflects the effectiveness of tax-related measures implemented under the program</narrative>
